{"_meta":{"openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Round saved","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Scoring and saving the round..."},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Call this to record one week of AI answers on a tracker, after create_tracker has returned its brand_id (never in the same step). Pass brand_id and answers: one item per tracked prompt and engine, each with prompt_id (such as p1), engine (such as openai, perplexity, google-ai-mode, claude), the answer text and its source links. week defaults to this ISO week; sending a week again replaces that week. Returns the scored round: mention share and citation share, split by engine and buyer prompt, with rivals, cited sites and a fix list. It scores pasted answers and never asks an engine. Errors: api_key_required, subscription_required (with checkout_url), owner_only for a seat's key, brand_not_found, and invalid_input naming the prompt ids to use.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"examples":[{"answers":[{"answer":"Acme CRM and HubSpot both suit a small agency.","engine":"openai","links":["https://acme.com/agencies","https://www.g2.com/categories/crm"],"prompt_id":"p1"},{"answer":"HubSpot has a free plan.","engine":"openai","links":["https://hubspot.com/pricing"],"prompt_id":"p2"}],"brand_id":"brand_0a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b","week":"2026-W42"}],"properties":{"answers":{"description":"One item per answer an AI engine gave to a tracked prompt: {prompt_id, engine, answer, links}. One answer per prompt and engine.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"answer":{"description":"The answer text, pasted in full.","maxLength":40000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"engine":{"description":"Which engine answered, such as openai, perplexity, google-ai-mode or claude.","maxLength":60,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"links":{"description":"The source links the engine showed with the answer.","items":{"maxLength":2000,"type":"string"